It should keep javascript url and id parameters with an empty body
{% javascript url:'~/Scripts/moment.min.js' id:'moment' %}{% endjavascript %}

It should keep javascript parameters with an empty multi-line body
{% javascript url:'~/Scripts/moment.min.js' id:'moment' references:'jquery' %}
{% endjavascript %}

It should keep javascript parameters and still format the body
{% javascript id:'x' disableanonymousfunction:'true' %}
var a = 1; function f(){return a}
{% endjavascript %}

It should keep javascript parameters with whitespace control
{%- javascript id:'x'   -%}
var a = 1;
{%- endjavascript -%}

It should keep stylesheet parameters and still format the body
{% stylesheet id:'x' compile:'less' %}
.a{color:red;.b{color:blue}}
{% endstylesheet %}

It should keep style parameters
{% style id:'y' %}
.a{color:red}
{% endstyle %}

It should keep sql parameters and still format the body
{% sql return:'rows' statement:'command' %}
select [NickName] from [Person] where [Id] = 1
{% endsql %}

It should keep sql parameters when the body contains Lava
{% sql return:'rows' %}
SELECT [NickName] FROM [Person] WHERE [LastName] = '{{ lastName }}'
{% endsql %}

It should leave raw tags without parameters unchanged
{% raw %}{{ not lava }}{% endraw %}

It should keep raw tag parameters inside a lava tag
{% lava
sql return:'rows' statement:'command'
select 1
endsql
javascript id:'x' url:'~/Scripts/a.js'
var a = 1;
endjavascript
stylesheet id:'s' compile:'less'
.a{color:red}
endstylesheet
%}
